      "content": "I understand you are busy, but self-diagnosing chest pain can be risky, as heart issues and severe indigestion can present similarly. While over-the-counter remedies might help mild reflux, taking a double dose or relying solely on them isn't a substitute for medical advice. If the discomfort persists or worsens, please seek immediate medical attention, as chest heaviness should always be taken seriously.",
